<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foster's says profit good for future.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foster's says profit good for future.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foster's Brewing Group Ltd said on Monday the net profit of A$293.3 million for the year to June 30, 1996 provided a strong platform for future growth.</p>
<p>But Foster's said it expects a greater tax liability in the 1996/97 year.</p>
</text>
